{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國倫敦全球著名的名店購物街牛津街（Oxford Street）周一（26日）起局部變成行人專用區，作為耗資1.5億鎊（約15.7億港元）的翻新計劃之一，旨在擺脫近年市道低迷的困局，並挑戰紐約第五大道及巴黎香榭麗舍大道等世界著名街區的地位。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.413634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:45:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:38:18.899807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.208573+00:00","content_hash":"a00280abb7aa9aa7c808559b51a7209e87ca3e00dd8cd3b90978047aa4f06d6f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}